###########################PRODUCTS##############################

GET http://localhost:3001/ HTTP/1.1

###
GET http://localhost:3001/products

###
GET http://localhost:3001/products/3

###
GET http://localhost:3001/products?page=1&limit=10

### Crear producto
POST http://localhost:3001/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"juanito",
  "price":"234.50"
}

### Actualizar
PATCH http://localhost:3001/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Mouse",
    "price":"150.0"
}


### Eliminacion
DELETE http://localhost:3001/products/3



###########################CLIENT-GATEWAY##############################

###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"prueba",
  "price": 123.456
}
###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/50
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"prueba",
  "price": 123.45
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/50

